{"articleNo":"72986","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=72986&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[LINC사업단]그린에너지연계전공/트랙장학금 선발 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.12.28","hit":"5974","attachments":[{"name":"GE장학금.xlsx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=72986&attachNo=2922"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><!--StartFragment--> </p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">[LINC사업단]그린에너지연계전공/트랙장학금 선발 안내</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><br></p><p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;LINC사업단에서 운영하고 있는 그린에너지 연계전공/트랙 교육과정을 이수하고 있는 학생을 대상으로 장학금 선발을 완료하였습니다.</p><p class=\"HStyle0\">◎ 선발학생:총 47명</p><p class=\"HStyle0\">◎ 선발방법:이수판별기준을 따른 학생중 등록금 범위내에서 장학금 지급</p><p class=\"HStyle0\">◎ 원스톱서비스에서 조회 가능-ACE사업단 재원(단, 계좌번호는 서류 제출 계좌 반영)</p><p class=\"HStyle0\">◎ 입금예정일:1월말</p><p class=\"HStyle0\">◎ 첨부파일을 통해 확인하시기 바랍니다.</p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><br></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">* 이수판별기준</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\">연계전공장학금</p><p class=\"HStyle0\">(매학기 필수/선택 구분 없이 2과목이상 수강-단, 최초학기는 한과목 이상 수강) </p><p class=\"HStyle0\">트랙이수(필수14+선택6=20학점:<span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">1월중 트랙이수증 신청예정</span>)</p><p class=\"HStyle0\">트랙장학금&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\"></p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"17\" valign=\"center\" width=\"106\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\">학기</p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"17\" valign=\"center\" width=\"231\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\">교과목</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"17\" valign=\"center\" width=\"106\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\">2학년 2학기</p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"17\" valign=\"center\" width=\"231\"><p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;필수 1과목 이상</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"17\" valign=\"center\" width=\"106\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\">3학년 1학기</p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"17\" valign=\"center\" width=\"231\"><p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;필수 2과목 이상</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"17\" valign=\"center\" width=\"106\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: